kome.commission.objective.settlement_defense=Protect our people at %s and put an end to the attack.
kome.commission.objective.stolen_goods=Find the raiders near %s and recover the stolen silver.
kome.commission.objective.border_incursion=Investigate the hostile force near %s and put an end to its threat.
kome.commission.objective.dangerous_escort=Protect your charge on the road to %s. Deal with the raiders along the way.
kome.commission.objective.relief=Bring the requested provisions to the people at %s.
kome.commission.speech.settlement_defense=Our people sheltering at %s have sent word of an attack. Go to their aid and see that they survive it. Return to me when they are safe.
kome.commission.speech.stolen_goods=Raiders have taken three bars of silver belonging to households under my protection. Their trail leads toward %s. Recover what was stolen and bring it back to me.
kome.commission.speech.border_incursion=Hostile forces have gathered near %s, threatening people on our roads. Find them and put an end to this incursion. Then bring me your report.
kome.commission.speech.dangerous_escort=A civilian in my care must reach %s. Raiders have been reported along that road. Take responsibility for safe passage, then return to me.
kome.commission.speech.relief=The people at %s have been left short of food. Bring them the provisions I have recorded. They must receive the aid there; afterward, report to me.
kome.commission.speech.reported=You have solved a problem entrusted to your care. I will remember this service when greater responsibility is considered.
kome.commission.speech.retry=This charge was lost. The encounter has been released. Speak to me again and we shall arrange another attempt.
kome.commission.speech.relief_complete=These provisions will sustain our people. You have our thanks. Take word of your service back to your Liege.
kome.commission.speech.relief_partial=We will keep what you can spare toward the requested provisions. Bring the remainder when you can.
kome.commission.failed=This charge was lost. Return to your Liege to arrange another attempt.
kome.commission.report=The field duty is complete. Return to your Liege and report your service.
kome.commission.recover=The raiders are defeated. Recover the stolen silver near %s and return it to your Liege.
